cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ilang.ai, please cite it as below."
title: "ilang.ai: the iLang protocol website and its agent-readable layer"
abstract: >-
  Source of the official iLang website at ilang.ai, published on Cloudflare
  Pages. It carries the protocol pages (specification, dictionary, playground,
  benchmark, conformance, ecosystem and the comparisons with MCP, A2A and
  GibberLink), the blog, and the machine-readable layer the site serves to AI
  agents: llms.txt and llms-full.txt, Markdown negotiation on every page, an
  OpenAPI document, a JSON schema directory, an API catalog, robots and
  sitemap files, and the /.well-known discovery records. Readme in eleven
  languages. MIT licensed.
type: software
authors:
